        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1752_6451.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Edel, vest, from, fürsichtig, ersam, und
<lb n="2"/>weise, ehrende liebe herren, guete <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freünd</unclear>
<lb n="3"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachparen</unclear>, denselben seyen unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündt=</unclear>
<lb n="4"/>nachparlich und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guetwillige</unclear> dienst ieder=
<lb n="5"/>zeit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuvor</unclear>.
<lb n="6"/>Es hat unß, unser lieber alter stataman,
<lb n="7"/><persName resp="#ner">Thomas <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Schmid</unclear> von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wellenstein</unclear></persName>, heüt dato
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geseßenem</unclear> rath <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zueerkhennen</unclear> geben, waß=
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">maßen</unclear> sein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freündtlicher</unclear> lieber <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">brueder</unclear>,
<lb n="10"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Marx</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Schmid</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">grichtsverwandter</unclear> alhie,
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihne</unclear> berichtet, wie daß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seinem</unclear> sohn <persName resp="#ner">Hanß
<lb n="12"/>Caspar <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Schmiden</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gerkher</unclear> handtwerckhs, von
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">etwelchen</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-60" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Bregenzischen</unclear></placeName> burgers söhnen, die
<lb n="14"/>auch dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gerkher</unclear> handtwerckh abwarten,
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">S. Gallen</placeName> etwas <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Iniuri</unclear>, schmach, und
<lb n="16"/>scheltwort, so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ihme</unclear> an seinem handtwerckh
<lb n="17"/>verhinderlich sein möchten, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürgeworfen</unclear> worden.
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wan</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ihme</unclear> herren stataman aber, und seinem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">brue=</unclear>
<lb n="19"/>der wol bewußt, daß bemelter <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ihr</unclear> sohn
<lb n="20"/>und vetter, sich die tag seines lebens,
<lb n="21"/>ahn allen enden und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">orthen</unclear>, wo er seinem handt=
<lb n="22"/>werckh nachgezogen, ehrlich und redlich, in=
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">maßen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sölches</unclear> mit seinen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewesten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mei=</unclear>
<lb n="24"/>stern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zubeweisen</unclear>, verhalten. Alß gelangten
<lb n="25"/>ahn unß, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ihr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beeder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vleißiges</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pitten</unclear>, wir
<lb n="26"/>wolten
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1752_6452.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">V</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">F</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">u</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">G</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in=</unclear>
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tercession</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürbitschrift</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> dem ende
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mitthailen</unclear>, daß sie von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ambts</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">obrigkhait</unclear>
<lb n="30"/>wegen, inquisition und nachforschung, wie
<lb n="31"/>solche <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ehrnverlezliche</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schmach=</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">scheltwort</unclear>
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ergangen</unclear> sein möchten, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">halten</unclear>, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß=</unclear>
<lb n="33"/>selbig, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hernach</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schriftlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zueüberschickhen</unclear>,
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unbeschwerdt</unclear> sein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wolten</unclear>.
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wan</unclear> sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dan</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hanß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Caspar</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Schmid</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßers</unclear>
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burgers</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sohn</unclear>, die zeit, so lang er sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bej</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sei=</unclear>
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">elteren</unclear> alhie, auch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-24" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Lindaw</unclear></placeName>, <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-194" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wangen</unclear></placeName>
<lb n="38"/><placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Würzburg</unclear></placeName> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anderstwo</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">aufenthalten</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">je=</unclear>
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">derzeit</unclear> (anderst unß nicht bewüßt) from
<lb n="40"/>redlich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erlich</unclear> erzaigt, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> auch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seinet=</unclear>
<lb n="41"/>halber <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nie</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">khain</unclear> clag <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürkhomen</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Alß</unclear>
<lb n="42"/>haben wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unserm</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hern</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stataman</unclear>
<lb n="43"/>und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seinem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">brueder</unclear> die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">begerte</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürschrift</unclear>
<lb n="44"/>umb der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">billichait</unclear> wegen, nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verwaige=</unclear>
<lb n="45"/>ren oder abschlagen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sollen</unclear> noch wöllen.
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Glangt</unclear> derwegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">V</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">F</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">u</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">G</unclear>.
<lb n="47"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündt</unclear> nachparlich und dienstlich
<lb n="48"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pitt</unclear>, die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geruehen</unclear> unß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> nachparlichem
<lb n="49"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">favor</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gunst</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">souil</unclear> inquisition und
<lb n="50"/>nachforschung <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">einzunemen</unclear>, und unß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schrift=</unclear>
<lb n="51"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lichen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zueüberschickhen</unclear>, wie, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gestalt</unclear>,
<lb n="52"/>und von wem, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angezogne</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schmach=</unclear> und
<lb n="53"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">scheltwort</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">spargirt</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">außgegoßen</unclear>
<lb n="54"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">worden</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1752_6453.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="55"/>werde, damit wir zu seiner zeit, gegen
<lb n="56"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">den</unclear> schuldigen auch die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebuer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">statuieren</unclear>,
<lb n="57"/>und fuernemen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">künden</unclear>.
<lb n="58"/>Wie E. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">V</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">F</unclear>. E. W. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wt</unclear>. wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dan</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">waß</unclear>
<lb n="59"/>sie in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">irer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Statgrichts</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">iurisdiction</unclear>
<lb n="60"/>gegen den schuldigen deßwegen, fuer <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">proceß</unclear>
<lb n="61"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">oder</unclear> straff, fuernemen werden, weder <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Maaß</unclear>
<lb n="62"/>noch Ordnung <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuerzeschriben</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sonder</unclear> allain
<lb n="63"/>wie <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">obstohet</unclear> gebetten haben wöllen.
<lb n="64"/>Daß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stohet</unclear> gegen inen unß, in dergleichen
<lb n="65"/>und andern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuetragenhaiten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">iederzeit</unclear>
<lb n="66"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freünd=</unclear> nachparlich, und dienstlich zuebe=
<lb n="67"/>schulden. Unß damit alle göttlicher all=
<lb n="68"/>macht <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">treülich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">empfhelendt</unclear>. Datum
<lb n="69"/>den <origDate when="1612-03-14" resp="#ner">14 <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Martii</unclear>. Anno 1612</origDate>.
<lb n="70"/><orgName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Stattaman und Rath
<lb n="71"/>der Stat Bregenz</orgName>,
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1752_6454.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="72"/>Den Edlen, Vesten, Fromen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Fuersichtigen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ersam</unclear>
<lb n="73"/>und weisen Herren N. N. <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Burgermaister</unclear>
<lb n="74"/>und Rath der Statt S. Gallen</orgName> unsern
<lb n="75"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">günsten</unclear> lieben Herren, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guetten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Freünden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear>
<lb n="76"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nachparn</unclear>.
<lb n="77"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">S. Gallen</placeName>.
</p>
